    bootstrap_macos_blocked_seed_compile_and_linux_only_stage3_authority_2026-09-06, 1, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/bootstrap_macos_blocked_seed_compile_and_linux_only_stage3_authority_2026-09-06.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    bootstrap_macos_blocked_seed_compile_and_linux_only_stage3_authority_2026-09-06, 2, "2026-11-26 macOS arm64 audit & fix (work/fix-macos-stage3-authority-20261126): audited cache_host_authority_v1.rs, authority.shs, manifest-verify.shs, stage3_fdwalk.c, bootstrap-from-scratch.sh, resume-stage3-from-admitted.sh. Fixed remaining macOS defects in authority.shs (bootstrap_stage3_git_budget_ms bare nproc -> getconf/sysctl/nproc fallback; BSD wc -l multi-space trimming via tr -d ' ' in hash_path_list/directory_snapshot/git_state). Live Darwin PASS: check-bootstrap-fd-identity.shs (33 fixtures), check-stage3-fdwalk-helper.shs (13 checks), cc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror stage3_fdwalk.c, macos_stage3_authority_portability_contract_test.shs. Full bootstrap-from-scratch.sh/resume-stage3-from-admitted.sh deferred under 14 GiB LLVM build memory guard; status set fix-implemented-verification-pending."

